  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "garden-news-radar (stack network)",
      "items": [
        "Page at /news-radar/ on the garden host: an Access JWT of the garden's own application, Fetch Metadata, CSRF and Origin on every POST",
        "/mcp for agents: the host garden-news-radar only, no Origin; the tunnel never routes it",
        "Fetches public addresses only, honours robots.txt, runs no script; no model",
        "Never connects to the app-server; uid 10002, read-only, no capabilities"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Garden executor (inside the app-server)",
      "items": [
        "With --news-radar, claims queued reports from /executor/v1/ with the stack's token",
        "Runs letta cron add --once from an argument array; posts results, the agent list and a heartbeat",
        "Agents can read its token: they can do what it does, which is no more than letta cron add"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "lettucectl (host)",
      "items": [
        "compose/news-radar.yml behind the garden-news-radar profile; check_news_radar keeps it hardened",
        "lettucectl mcp registers the News Radar server; lettucectl skills installs news-radar-sources",
        "up copies the NEWS_RADAR_* settings from config.env; backup copies news-radar-data"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Trust notes",
      "items": [
        "A report is queued only at a schedule, when something is new, within the daily cap per agent",
        "Website text reaches the agent between markers, as data; a site can't write the end marker",
        "Left out: the garden landing page, Gmail triggers, the vault, the code editor"
      ]
    }
  ]
